Package: proviz
Title: Process Mining Analysis and Authoring Tools for Protrace
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Frenk", "Giorgetti", email = "frenk.giorgetti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Companion analysis package to protrace: turns
    protrace_event logs into bupaR eventlogs and process-mining reports,
    and provides authoring aids for instrumenting a new Shiny application --
    starting with a static-analysis scanner that inventories an app's
    inputs, observers, and UI widgets as candidate hook points for a human
    to map onto a business process (see protrace's process mining
    playbook). Kept separate from protrace so instrumenting an application
    never requires this package's heavier dependencies.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
